  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to civic awareness and participation in the Constitutional Review process and Voter Education and Observation of Electoral Processes through Consortium of National and International NGOs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Support to civic awareness and participation in the Constitutional Review process and Voter Education and Observation of Electoral Processes through Consortium of National and International NGOs is a component of Institutions of Democratic Empowerment and Accountability (IDEA) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;4,905,012. It works in the following sector(s): Elections, Democratic participation and civil society, Media and free flow of information.</narrative>
  </description>
